WEBVTT

00:03:59.496 --> 00:04:02.704
A high glycemic food, such as white bread,

00:04:02.746 --> 00:04:05.371
causes a rapid release of glucose
into the blood,

00:04:05.413 --> 00:04:07.371
and then comes the dip.

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:11.496
Blood sugar shoots down,
and with it, our attention span and mood.

00:04:11.538 --> 00:04:15.621
On the other hand, oats, grains,
and legumes have slower glucose release,

00:04:15.663 --> 00:04:19.079
enabling a steadier level
of attentiveness.

00:04:19.829 --> 00:04:21.829
For sustained brain power,

00:04:21.871 --> 00:04:26.913
opting for a varied diet 
of nutrient-rich foods is critical.

00:04:27.788 --> 00:04:30.454
When it comes to what you bite,
chew, and swallow,